The Wema CashFlow

Problem: Many customers, especially SMEs, don't have a clear picture of their cash flow.

Idea: A banking intelligence platform that turns transaction history into useful insights:

> “Your expenses increased 23% this month.”



> “Your recurring payments are due soon.”



> “Based on your previous activity, your balance may become low within X days.”



Could also give SMEs simple revenue/expense categorization.

MVP: Upload/simulate transaction data → automatic categorization → dashboard → cash-flow insights.

This one is very demo-friendly because judges can immediately see the value.